          }
        },
        "subheading_3GHFkK": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Did you know your skin is your body's largest organ? What you put ON your body is just as important as what you put IN your body...",
            "text_size": 4,
            "padding_bottom": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_RpG7t4": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "THE WELLNESS INDUSTRY TAUGHT US TO QUESTION WHAT WE EAT. WE ARE HERE TO QUESTION WHAT WE WEAR.",
            "text_size": 4,
            "padding_bottom": 12
          }
        },
        "text_qPpCeY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>LINEN IS THE WORLDS MOST SUSTAINABLE, WELLNESS-BOOSTING & HIGH PERFORMANCE NATURAL FIBER.</p><p>Linen is a natural fiber made from the flax plant, renowned for its restorative and metaphysical properties. Linen is the only fabric in the world that contains lignans, a unique wound healing compound (inflammation-reducing polyphenols), making it natures only \"healing\" fiber. Linen is the only fabric mentioned over 100 times in the Bible, regarded as a divine and holy material!</p><p>Organic Linen provides a wide range of benefits when it comes in contact with skin, and is often used in the medical industry for heart surgery, due to its natural wound-healing properties. Linen is naturally anti-bacterial, hypoallergenic, breathable, odor-resistant, moisture-wicking and temperature regulating— making it the premier natural fiber to protect your body's most sensitive areas. It is fertility-friendly and supports a healthy skin microbiome. Not only does linen promote wellness with wear, it lasts twice as long as cotton or synthetic fabrics, and softens with every wash!  </p><p></p><p>Heavenly Essentials is excited to offer the world's first 100% GOTS Certified Organic linen knitted fabric, made exclusively for intimate wear! We developed a revolutionary fabric and first of its-kind- linen elastic trim, exclusively made from the miracle flax plant. Our team combined these cutting-edge materials with contemporary designs, that are comfortable and stylish. We are excited to offer spiritual garments, that enhance your body's vibrational frequency and support the well-being of delicate areas.</p><p></p><h6><strong>Exclusively 100% Flax Fibers. </strong></h6>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
