        "text_k3FGtg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The industry calls it \"recycled\". We call it what it is: plastic. <strong>Clothing made from polyester is created using petroleum-based plastic, a material linked to cancer risks, hormonal disruption, and infertility.</strong></p><p>A shredded bottle, spun into thread, treated with toxic chemicals, and worn against your skin, all-day long. Researchers are now finding plastic in human blood and testicular tissue.</p><p><br/>Polyester is cheap, easy to source, and carries a higher margin over natural fibers like linen. Synthetic underwear sits on the most permeable skin on your body. The chemicals it leaches are absorbing directly into your reproductive area. The vulvar/penile skin is one of the most absorbent skin areas on the body. What sits against it all day gets absorbed directly into your circulatory and lymphatic systems. </p><p></p><p>Reproductive issues are at an all time high, with 1 in 6 people globally affected by infertility. Man-made fabrics and chemical-derived dyes are directly linked with a number of health issues, including: cancer, infertility, metabolic disorders, skin problems, allergies and autoimmune diseases. Heavenly Essentials offers a natural solution to this problem!</p><p>We believe intimate wear has lost its way. Synthetic fibres, chemical finishes, and plastic-polyester construction have become the default, sold to you as premium. We believe that's backwards. We're not here to follow the industry. </p><p>We're here to restore what fabric was always meant to be: natural, traceable, and built to last. Natural fibers support healthy hormones like testosterone.</p><p></p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
