        "text_yFfHPX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Heavenly Essentials is in a league of its own. With 100% linen knit fabrics, natural material accents, and effortlessly elegant styles, there is truly no competition.</strong></p><p>We believe fabric is your second skin — what touches your body should be as pure as what you put in it. Our linen is fully biodegradable, breathable, and free from harmful chemicals, pesticides, and toxic treatments.</p><p>No hidden chemicals, no toxins. Just clean softness that lasts.</p><p><strong>Heavenly Essentials</strong> combines timeless styles with ultra-premium, organic materials. Thoughtfully designed for daily wear, that are more comfortable and durable than conventional underwear.</p><p> Every piece is made using the highest quality European flax linen and is completely chemical-free. All our products are <strong>100% plastic-free and have Zero synthetic materials or toxic dyes.</strong> </p><p><strong>* Free of Petrochemicals, Fossil Fuels, Pesticides, PFAS and BPAs.</strong></p><ul><li>Soft & Organic</li><li>Hypoallergenic</li><li>Naturally Antibacterial & Moisture-wicking</li><li>Bleach-free (no chlorine)</li><li>Thermoregulation and Breathable</li><li>Bioavailable, Wound healing properties </li></ul><p><strong>INTIMATES THAT SUPPORT YOUR WELL-BEING.</strong></p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
