        "text_gJPtCA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Innovative Materials... from Nature",
            "subheading_size": 3,
            "title": "Organic Linen Elastic & Organic Linen Thread",
            "heading_size": 7,
            "text": "<p>Our Heavenly collection is made with only the highest quality natural materials, harvested directly from the Earth. Our intimates are breathable, supremely soft, rich in texture, and comfortable for all-day wear. We replace petroleum-based synthetics with natural alternatives.</p><p>Every pair of Heavenlies has been thoughtfully designed, down to the thread. Each piece features a premium, organic linen elastic, made from a blend of organic flax and natural tree rubber threads: the first of it's kind. All our pieces are fully biodegradable and compostable, at end-of-life, making them the most sustainable underwear to ever exist.  </p><p>As a Biblically-based brand, we believe in not mixing materials, as instructed in Levitical law, (Leviticus 19:19 and Deuteronomy 22:11). Every detail matters in the construction of our intimates. Most 'natural' underwear brands use various materials and have synthetic, polyester (plastic) trims and poly thread, which are toxic for your body and the environment. </p><p>We exclusively use FSC-certified, natural tree rubber (no synthetic rubber) in our organic linen elastic trims. Every pair is sewn with 100% organic linen sewing thread. Heavenly Essentials is proud to be the only underwear brand in the world that features these state-of-the-art materials! </p><p>After years of wear, plant your Heavenlies in the ground and watch them turn back into nutrient-rich soil - a truly regenerative and circular garment.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "button_text": "Learn more",
            "button_url": "shopify://pages/biblical-references",
            "button_type": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "show_arrow": false,
            "show_social_links": false,
            "text_columns": 1,
            "align_text": "text-left",
            "bg_color": "",
            "color": ""
          }
        }
